The entities are not directly under Jellyfin.Server but likely under Jellyfin.Database or another project. The MigrateLinkedChildren class is internal, so I cannot directly instantiate it from a test project. The Perform method is public, so I can test it by calling Perform, but I need to mock the dependencies and the DbContext.

I will try to create a test that calls Perform and verifies that the logger logs the expected message "No items from deleted libraries found." by setting up the DbContext to return no orphaned items.

Since the class is internal, I will use InternalsVisibleTo attribute if available or use reflection to invoke Perform.

I will write a test that mocks the dependencies, sets up the DbContext to simulate no orphaned items, and verifies the logger call.

I will submit a test file with this approach now.

